.TH COOKIECLICKER 6 "2026-06-13" "cookieclicker 1.0.6" "Games Manual"
.SH NAME
cookieclicker \- terminal clone of the Cookie Clicker idle game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cookieclicker
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cookieclicker
is a terminal (text mode) clone of Orteil's Cookie Clicker idle game,
written in C++17.
.PP
Tap cookies to bake them, spend cookies on buildings to raise your
cookies-per-second, buy tap and CPS upgrades, and unlock achievements.
.SH CONTROLS
.TP
.B c
Bake a cookie (gain cookies-per-tap).
.TP
.B 1-5
Switch between the Store, Inventory, Upgrades, Achievements and Options
views.
.TP
letter keys
Buy the building or upgrade shown next to that key.
.TP
.B q
Quit the game.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B .cookieclicker.save
Savegame, written to the current working directory.
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/RaymiiOrg/c_ookieclicker
